:: Evidence {"position":"2650,1100","size":"100,100"}
TO BE ADDED TO AS WE DETERMINE EVIDENCE PIECES IN THE GAME
ALSO ALSO IT'S JUST HERE SO WE HAVE AN IDEA OF WHAT'S THERE

ALSO I SORTED WHAT WE WILL PROBABLY USE INTO 3 CATEGORIES

General: Evidence that will generally stay the same no matter who the killer is. There will be footprints in the garden, for example. Tiny details may change but the core evidence is the same

Variable: evidence that changes depending on the killer but it's use-case is pretty similar. Bu7L-R will be damaged, but how they're damaged is different depending on the route. The Matriarch's wounds will be different, but we will still get an evidence piece about her wounds.

Decisive: evidence that is only used during 1 killer's route. If we get it in other routes, it's next to useless/a red herring


we miiiiight want a 4th category for evidence used in 2/3 routes but that's really getting into the minutia 


